software, research papers, website captures, or third-party solution traces.

The selected XSokoban layouts are credited to Thinking Rabbit in the original
collection. Layout identity was checked against Andrew Myers's XSokoban 3.3c
distribution at https://www.cs.cornell.edu/andru/release/xsokoban-3.3c.tar.gz.

Public numerical lower-bound evidence is attributed to Andre G. Pereira,
Robert Holte, Jonathan Schaeffer, Luciana S. Buriol and Marcus Ritt,
